{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #f4e7d0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #5b412d; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 26px 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #5b412d; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #5b412d; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 24px 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e风在沙丘上画出绵延的等高线，像一张摊开的复古地形图，把远方的温度带到眼前。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/minimal-architecture.jpg\" alt=\"日光下的建筑几何与暖调光影\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003csection style=\"background-color: #e6cba6; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 36px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 22px 18px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #8d4e2d; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e大地色系的旷野杂志气质\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #5b412d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e细腻的赤陶沙色地形等高线铺满整页，在全库里独此一份，非常适合地理与远行故事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #8d4e2d; color: #5b412d; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; padding: 24px 8px; text-align: right\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e出发去旷野，是为了让眼睛重新习惯地平线的辽阔。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 36px 0 0 auto; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 14px 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; color: #8d4e2d; display: block; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 25px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 0 0 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e地理与游记的排版优势\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e暖沙大地底纹一眼区分于普通白底模板\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e赭红章节色与暖棕正文浑然一体\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e配风景、人文和建筑摄影格外高级\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #856342; color: #5b412d; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e每一道等高线背后，都是一段值得走过的路。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
